                    <svg width="64" height="65" viewBox="0 0 64 65" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="text-primary">
                        <path d="M56.9951 45.2759C55.6151 48.3409 54.9501 49.7109 53.1751 52.4159C50.6901 56.1959 47.1851 60.9159 42.8551 60.9459C39.0001 60.9809 38.0051 58.4309 32.7701 58.4759C27.5401 58.5009 26.4501 60.9959 22.5901 60.9559C18.2551 60.9159 14.9401 56.6659 12.4551 52.8909C5.50505 42.3059 4.77005 29.8959 9.06505 23.2959C12.1051 18.6159 16.9101 15.8659 21.4251 15.8659C26.0251 15.8659 28.9151 18.3909 32.7151 18.3909C36.4051 18.3909 38.6501 15.8609 43.9701 15.8609C47.9901 15.8609 52.2401 18.0509 55.2801 21.8309C45.3401 27.2809 46.9551 41.4759 56.9951 45.2759ZM39.9301 11.6359C41.8651 9.15093 43.3351 5.64593 42.8001 2.07593C39.6451 2.29093 35.9551 4.30593 33.8001 6.91593C31.8451 9.29593 30.2251 12.8259 30.8551 16.2409C34.3001 16.3509 37.8651 14.2959 39.9301 11.6359Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                    </svg><span>آیفون / مک</span>
